{"out": "S0E10_baydat", "end": "شباب، اسألوا بالتعليقات أو بالخاص… ما حدا رح يعرف", "endsub": "Guys, ask in the comments or DM. Nobody will know", "lines": [{"who": "Wadad", "ar": "سعاد… لازم نحكي بموضوع حسّاس.", "en": "Souad… we need to talk about something sensitive.", "img": "/tmp/claude-0/-home-claude/988431de-1e8a-5e55-a69c-1b6d3578148a/scratchpad/car/c01c.png", "z": [1.1, 1.25, 0.4, 0.55], "audio": "/tmp/claude-0/-home-claude/988431de-1e8a-5e55-a69c-1b6d3578148a/scratchpad/s0e345/e10_l01.mp3"}, {"who": "Souad", "ar": "البيضات؟", "en": "The baydat?", "img": "/tmp/claude-0/-home-claude/988431de-1e8a-5e55-a69c-1b6d3578148a/scratchpad/car/c01c.png", "z": [1.4, 1.55, 0.65, 0.55], "audio": "/tmp/claude-0/-home-claude/988431de-1e8a-5e55-a69c-1b6d3578148a/scratchpad/s0e345/e10_l02.mp3"}, {"who": "guest", "ar": "شو؟! ليش نحنا؟!", "en": "What?! Why us?!", "img": "/home/claude/btbtp-media/refs/baydat_in_world.jpg", "z": [1.0, 1.15, 0.5, 0.6], "audio": "/tmp/claude-0/-home-claude/988431de-1e8a-5e55-a69c-1b6d3578148a/scratchpad/s0e345/e10_l03.mp3"}, {"who": "Wadad", "ar": "لمّا الكلى بتتعب، الهرمونات بتخربط… والتستوستيرون بينزل.", "en": "When the kidneys fail, hormones get mixed up… and testosterone drops.", "img": "/tmp/claude-0/-home-claude/988431de-1e8a-5e55-a69c-1b6d3578148a/scratchpad/car/c01b.png", "z": [1.05, 1.2, 0.5, 0.6], "audio": "/tmp/claude-0/-home-claude/988431de-1e8a-5e55-a69c-1b6d3578148a/scratchpad/s0e345/e10_l04.mp3"}, {"who": "Souad", "ar": "والخصوبة كمان بتتأثّر، وفي شغلات الشباب ما بيحكوها.", "en": "Fertility is affected too, and there are things guys never say out loud.", "img": "/tmp/claude-0/-home-claude/988431de-1e8a-5e55-a69c-1b6d3578148a/scratchpad/s0e2/aunties.png", "z": [1.55, 1.7, 0.66, 0.5], "audio": "/tmp/claude-0/-home-claude/988431de-1e8a-5e55-a69c-1b6d3578148a/scratchpad/s0e345/e10_l05.mp3"}, {"who": "guest", "ar": "خلص خلص! فهمنا!", "en": "Okay okay! We get it!", "img": "/home/claude/btbtp-media/refs/baydat_scene.jpg", "z": [1.3, 1.5, 0.5, 0.62], "audio": "/tmp/claude-0/-home-claude/988431de-1e8a-5e55-a69c-1b6d3578148a/scratchpad/s0e345/e10_l06.mp3"}, {"who": "New kidney", "ar": "بعد الزراعة؟ كتير مرّات الأمور بتتحسّن. بس كل حالة غير، اسألوا فريقكن وما تستحوا.", "en": "After the transplant? Things often get better. Every case is different: ask your team, don't be shy.", "img": "/tmp/claude-0/-home-claude/988431de-1e8a-5e55-a69c-1b6d3578148a/scratchpad/s0e2/newkidney.png", "z": [1.0, 1.12, 0.5, 0.5], "audio": "/tmp/claude-0/-home-claude/988431de-1e8a-5e55-a69c-1b6d3578148a/scratchpad/s0e345/e10_l07.mp3"}]}